Just to clarify, my critical post _did_ contain the sentence
"Damn apathetic net.jerks", but was intended as a dramatic
portrayal of the typical response of self-proclaimed net.visionaries
when nobody devotes much time to their Vision.  I have no reason
to suspect that M. Rose is a "jerk" and regret any confusion.

